<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="New Man"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Ed Sheeran"/><amll:meta key="album" value="÷ (Deluxe)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="GBAHS1700010"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1193701440"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="176552149"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Zennmn"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Ammar Malik</songwriter><songwriter>Benjamin Levin</songwriter><songwriter>Ed Sheeran</songwriter><songwriter>Jessie Ware</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">Na-na-na-na 来吧</text><text for="L2">听说他花了五百英镑买牛仔裤</text><text for="L3">每周至少去六趟健身房</text><text for="L4">穿着双鞋却偏偏不穿袜子</text><text for="L5">听说他又开始节食 吃什么都要精打细算</text><text for="L6">他修了眉毛 连屁眼都漂白</text><text for="L7">Ministry 的唱片他一张不落地收藏</text><text for="L8">身上纹着部落图腾 却不懂其中含义</text><text for="L9">不过听说他让你快乐 那我也无妨</text><text for="L10">可是话说回来</text><text for="L11">我只是在实话实说</text><text for="L12">我仍会偷偷翻看你的 Instagram</text><text for="L13">还要忍住不去双击那些旧照片</text><text for="L14">因为我知道那会惹出麻烦</text><text for="L15">让我提醒你那些你曾牵着我的日子</text><text for="L16">还有我们用苹果酒罐喝香槟的时候</text><text for="L17">如果你是露易丝·莱恩 我想我不是超人</text><text for="L18">我只是个渴望被爱的少年</text><text for="L19">就让我把这份爱给你 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(Na-na-na-na 来吧)</span></text><text for="L20">我不想知道你新欢的事</text><text for="L21">因为若你们真是天生一对</text><text for="L22">你就不会打电话给我 想要</text><text for="L23">因为我确信他也不想知道我的事</text><text for="L24">我不想听你说起新欢</text><text for="L25">我们终究会走到那一步</text><text for="L26">我知道你想念这样的一份爱</text><text for="L27">但我确信他不想听到我的事</text><text for="L28">你的新欢在郊区租了栋房子</text><text for="L29">肩上背着男士包 我却叫它手提包</text><text for="L30">每年他都会和哥们儿去马拉加</text><text for="L31">他喝着啤酒却有六块腹肌 我还有点嫉妒</text><text for="L32">冬天的夜里 他在室内也戴着墨镜</text><text for="L33">每当说唱响起 他就比出手枪的姿势</text><text for="L34">嘴里喊着「好曲子！警察照亮整个房间！」</text><text for="L35">不过不说他了 姑娘 还是说说你吧</text><text for="L36">你曾是那种坐在水边读书的女孩</text><text for="L37">吃着一包薯片 绝不会做出背叛的事</text><text for="L38">如今你吃羽衣甘蓝 频繁去健身</text><text for="L39">追着凯莉和金的潮流</text><text for="L40">在夜店的角落吻着另一个男孩</text><text for="L41">好吧 你需要独处</text><text for="L42">想找人聊聊的话 可以打给我</text><text for="L43">我只是觉得该告诉你 因为你应该知道</text><text for="L44">你仍是那个渴望被爱的女孩</text><text for="L45">就让我把这份爱给你 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(Na-na-na-na 来吧)</span></text><text for="L46">我不想知道你新欢的事</text><text for="L47">因为若你们真是命中注定</text><text for="L48">你就不会打电话给我 想要</text><text for="L49">因为我确信他也不想知道我的事</text><text for="L50">我不想听你说起新欢</text><text for="L51">我们终究会走到那一步</text><text for="L52">我知道你想念这样的一份爱</text><text for="L53">但我确信他不想听到我的事</text><text for="L54">亲爱的 我并不想毁了你这一周</text><text for="L55">只是你的样子变得太多</text><text for="L56">和他在一起时 我知道你很孤单</text><text for="L57">请记得你依然有自由</text><text for="L58">可以做出选择 然后离开</text><text for="L59">别只打给我 你得让我看到 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(Na-na-na-na 来吧)</span></text><text for="L60">我不想知道你新欢的事</text><text for="L61">因为若你们真是天生一对</text><text for="L62">你就不会打电话给我 想要</text><text for="L63">因为我确信他也不想知道我的事 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(Na-na-na-na 来吧)</span></text><text for="L64">我不想听你说起新欢</text><text for="L65">我们终究会走到那一步</text><text for="L66">我知道你想念这样的一份爱</text><text for="L67">但我确信他不想听到我的事 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(Na-na-na-na 来吧)</span></text><text for="L68">我确信他不想知道</text><text for="L69">我确信他不想听到</text><text for="L70">我不想知道 道 道你新欢的事 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(Na-na-na-na 来吧)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:05.106"><div begin="0:00.090" end="3:05.106"><p begin="0:00.090" end="0:01.153" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:00.090" end="0:00.340">Na-</span><span begin="0:00.340" end="0:00.470">na-</span><span begin="0:00.470" end="0:00.646">na-</span><span begin="0:00.646" end="0:00.818">na,</span> <span begin="0:00.818" end="0:01.153">now</span></p><p begin="0:11.320" end="0:13.620" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.320" end="0:11.330">I</span> <span begin="0:11.330" end="0:11.550">heard</span> <span begin="0:11.550" end="0:11.640">he</span> <span begin="0:11.640" end="0:11.990">spent</span> <span begin="0:11.990" end="0:12.330">five</span> <span begin="0:12.330" end="0:12.510">hun</span><span begin="0:12.510" end="0:12.600">dred</span> <span begin="0:12.600" end="0:13.030">pounds</span> <span begin="0:13.030" end="0:13.260">on</span> <span begin="0:13.260" end="0:13.620">jeans</span></p><p begin="0:13.923" end="0:16.153" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.923" end="0:14.243">Goes</span> <span begin="0:14.243" end="0:14.383">to</span> <span begin="0:14.383" end="0:14.513">the</span> <span begin="0:14.513" end="0:14.783">gym</span> <span begin="0:14.783" end="0:14.883">at</span> <span begin="0:14.883" end="0:15.143">least</span> <span begin="0:15.143" end="0:15.393">six</span> <span begin="0:15.393" end="0:15.723">times</span> <span begin="0:15.723" end="0:15.843">a</span> <span begin="0:15.843" end="0:16.153">week</span></p><p begin="0:16.463" end="0:18.763" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.463" end="0:16.733">Wears</span> <span begin="0:16.733" end="0:17.023">both</span> <span begin="0:17.023" end="0:17.403">shoes</span> <span begin="0:17.403" end="0:17.543">with</span> <span begin="0:17.543" end="0:17.713">no</span> <span begin="0:17.713" end="0:18.113">socks</span> <span begin="0:18.113" end="0:18.233">on</span> <span begin="0:18.233" end="0:18.453">his</span> <span begin="0:18.453" end="0:18.763">feet</span></p><p begin="0:18.766" end="0:21.106" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.766" end="0:18.906">And</span> <span begin="0:18.906" end="0:19.036">I</span> <span begin="0:19.036" end="0:19.206">hear</span> <span begin="0:19.206" end="0:19.386">he's</span> <span begin="0:19.386" end="0:19.536">on</span> <span begin="0:19.536" end="0:19.636">a</span> <span begin="0:19.636" end="0:19.796">new</span> <span begin="0:19.796" end="0:20.026">di</span><span begin="0:20.026" end="0:20.156">et</span> <span begin="0:20.156" end="0:20.306">and</span> <span begin="0:20.306" end="0:20.496">watch</span><span begin="0:20.496" end="0:20.616">es</span> <span begin="0:20.616" end="0:20.766">what</span> <span begin="0:20.766" end="0:20.896">he</span> <span begin="0:20.896" end="0:21.106">eats</span></p><p begin="0:21.107" end="0:23.915" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.107" end="0:21.267">He's</span> <span begin="0:21.267" end="0:21.427">got</span> <span begin="0:21.427" end="0:21.617">his</span> <span begin="0:21.617" end="0:21.857">eye</span><span begin="0:21.857" end="0:22.187">brows</span> <span begin="0:22.187" end="0:22.587">plucked</span> <span begin="0:22.587" end="0:22.687">and</span> <span begin="0:22.687" end="0:22.897">his</span> <span begin="0:22.897" end="0:23.157">arse</span><span begin="0:23.157" end="0:23.437">hole</span> <span begin="0:23.437" end="0:23.915">bleached</span></p><p begin="0:24.139" end="0:26.309" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.139" end="0:24.489">Owns</span> <span begin="0:24.489" end="0:24.629">ev</span><span begin="0:24.629" end="0:24.719">ery</span> <span begin="0:24.719" end="0:24.929">sin</span><span begin="0:24.929" end="0:25.049">gle</span> <span begin="0:25.049" end="0:25.249">Min</span><span begin="0:25.249" end="0:25.409">is</span><span begin="0:25.409" end="0:25.609">try</span> <span begin="0:25.609" end="0:26.019">C</span><span begin="0:26.019" end="0:26.309">D</span></p><p begin="0:26.614" end="0:28.724" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.614" end="0:26.874">Tri</span><span begin="0:26.874" end="0:27.034">bal</span> <span begin="0:27.034" end="0:27.294">tat</span><span begin="0:27.294" end="0:27.574">toos</span> <span begin="0:27.574" end="0:27.694">and</span> <span begin="0:27.694" end="0:27.834">he</span> <span begin="0:27.834" end="0:28.004">don't</span> <span begin="0:28.004" end="0:28.144">know</span> <span begin="0:28.144" end="0:28.304">what</span> <span begin="0:28.304" end="0:28.444">it</span> <span begin="0:28.444" end="0:28.724">means</span></p><p begin="0:28.903" end="0:31.291" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.903" end="0:29.093">But</span> <span begin="0:29.093" end="0:29.253">I</span> <span begin="0:29.253" end="0:29.403">heard</span> <span begin="0:29.403" end="0:29.513">he</span> <span begin="0:29.513" end="0:29.743">makes</span> <span begin="0:29.743" end="0:29.873">you</span> <span begin="0:29.873" end="0:30.003">hap</span><span begin="0:30.003" end="0:30.143">py,</span> <span begin="0:30.143" end="0:30.303">so</span> <span begin="0:30.303" end="0:30.503">that's</span> <span begin="0:30.503" end="0:30.813">fine</span> <span begin="0:30.813" end="0:31.113">by</span> <span begin="0:31.113" end="0:31.291">me</span></p><p begin="0:31.413" end="0:31.943" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.413" end="0:31.473">But</span> <span begin="0:31.473" end="0:31.943">still</span></p><p begin="0:32.743" end="0:33.803" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.743" end="0:32.903">I'm</span> <span begin="0:32.903" end="0:33.073">just</span> <span begin="0:33.073" end="0:33.243">keep</span><span begin="0:33.243" end="0:33.413">in'</span> <span begin="0:33.413" end="0:33.573">it</span> <span begin="0:33.573" end="0:33.803">real</span></p><p begin="0:33.802" end="0:36.622" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.802" end="0:34.012">Still</span> <span begin="0:34.012" end="0:34.132">look</span><span begin="0:34.132" end="0:34.352">in'</span> <span begin="0:34.352" end="0:34.462">at</span> <span begin="0:34.462" end="0:34.642">your</span> <span begin="0:34.642" end="0:34.752">In</span><span begin="0:34.752" end="0:34.922">sta</span><span begin="0:34.922" end="0:35.212">gram</span> <span begin="0:35.212" end="0:35.342">and</span> <span begin="0:35.342" end="0:35.452">I'll</span> <span begin="0:35.452" end="0:35.552">be</span> <span begin="0:35.552" end="0:35.812">creep</span><span begin="0:35.812" end="0:35.992">in'</span> <span begin="0:35.992" end="0:36.092">a</span> <span begin="0:36.092" end="0:36.622">lil'</span></p><p begin="0:36.623" end="0:39.133" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.623" end="0:36.753">I'll</span> <span begin="0:36.753" end="0:36.873">be</span> <span begin="0:36.873" end="0:37.073">try</span><span begin="0:37.073" end="0:37.233">in'</span> <span begin="0:37.233" end="0:37.383">not</span> <span begin="0:37.383" end="0:37.493">to</span> <span begin="0:37.493" end="0:37.693">dou</span><span begin="0:37.693" end="0:37.833">ble</span> <span begin="0:37.833" end="0:38.103">tap</span> <span begin="0:38.333" end="0:38.513">from</span> <span begin="0:38.513" end="0:38.743">way</span> <span begin="0:38.743" end="0:39.133">back</span></p><p begin="0:39.133" end="0:40.633" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.133" end="0:39.333">'Cause</span> <span begin="0:39.333" end="0:39.433">I</span> <span begin="0:39.433" end="0:39.613">know</span> <span begin="0:39.613" end="0:39.783">that's</span> <span begin="0:39.783" end="0:39.923">where</span> <span begin="0:39.923" end="0:40.013">th